# 🛒 Stock Management System

A full-stack Stock Management System built using **React.js** for the frontend and **Django (DRF)** for the backend. This application allows users to register, log in, manage products, track stock levels, view sold items, and visualize sales analytics.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo

- **Frontend (Netlify)**: [https://your-frontend-link.netlify.app](https://your-frontend-link.netlify.app)
- **Backend (Render)**: [https://stockmanagement-3htt.onrender.com](https://stockmanagement-3htt.onrender.com)

---

## 📦 Features

- 🔐 User Authentication (Register/Login)
- 📦 Product Creation and Stock Overview
- ✅ Edit & Mark Products as Sold
- 📊 Revenue Analytics with Charts
- 🔍 Responsive UI with Tailwind CSS
- 🔗 API Integration using Axios

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- **React.js**
- **Tailwind CSS**
- **Axios**
- **React Router DOM**

### Backend
- **Django**
- **Django REST Framework (DRF)**
- **MySQL** (or SQLite if not configured)

### Deployment
- Frontend: **Netlify**
- Backend: **Render**

---

